Spec: SpecDD Path References

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Coordinate SpecDD path, glob, inline-code path, and explicit symbol references.

Structure:
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceExtractor.kt: Text-level path and glob candidate extraction.
  ./SpecDDCodeReferenceExtractor.kt: Backticked inline code candidate extraction.
  ./SpecDDSymbolReferenceExtractor.kt: Explicit `@` symbol reference candidate extraction.
  ./SpecDDPathResolver.kt: VFS-based project-relative path and glob target resolution.
  ./SpecDDReferenceTextUpdater.kt: Document-backed reference text replacement for refactors.
  ./SpecDDPathReference.kt: IntelliJ PSI reference for path and glob candidates.
  ./SpecDDSymbolReference.kt: IntelliJ PSI reference for explicit `@` symbol candidates.
  ./SpecDDReferencesSearch.kt: IntelliJ references search bridge for code-side rename and find usages.
  ./SpecDDReferenceRenameHandler.kt: IntelliJ rename handler for rename invoked from SpecDD references.
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceProvider.kt: IntelliJ reference provider.
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceContributor.kt: IntelliJ reference contributor registration.
  ./SpecDDPathAnnotator.kt: IntelliJ warning annotator for unresolved path, glob, and symbol candidates.
  ./SpecDDCreateFileQuickFix.kt: IntelliJ intention action for creating unresolved exact path references.

Owns:
  ./references.sdd
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceExtractor.sdd
  ./SpecDDCodeReferenceExtractor.sdd
  ./SpecDDSymbolReferenceExtractor.sdd
  ./SpecDDPathResolver.sdd
  ./SpecDDReferenceTextUpdater.sdd
  ./SpecDDPathReference.sdd
  ./SpecDDSymbolReference.sdd
  ./SpecDDReferencesSearch.sdd
  ./SpecDDReferenceRenameHandler.sdd
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceProvider.sdd
  ./SpecDDPathReferenceContributor.sdd
  ./SpecDDPathAnnotator.sdd
  ./SpecDDCreateFileQuickFix.sdd
